# {{REPO_NAME}} knowledge base

This directory is an [OKF v0.2](https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/knowledge-catalog/blob/main/okf/SPEC.md)
bundle. Every file except `index.md` and `log.md` starts with YAML
frontmatter carrying at least `type`, plus `title`, `description` and
`generated: {by, at}`. Add `verified: [{by: human:<email>, at}]` when a person
confirms a document, and `stale_after` when it needs periodic review.

Run `make check-docs` to check conformance and `make docs-index` to refresh
the listings below.

